---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Gaurav Pathak, wildlife and bird photographer.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap post-body">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h1>Gaurav Pathak</h1>
      <p>I photograph birds and wildlife across India — from the grasslands of Assam to the high-altitude cold deserts of Spiti. What started as a way to slow down has become a habit of travelling far, waiting long, and paying close attention to things that mostly go unnoticed.</p>
      <p>I shoot on a Canon R5 paired with the RF 600mm F4, and I write about the trips, the misses, and the occasional moment that makes the wait worthwhile on the <a href="/blog">journal</a>.</p>
      <p>If you'd like to follow along, I post regularly on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/gauravsfeatheredframes" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>, and a small collection of prints is in the works — see the <a href="/prints">prints page</a> for updates.</p>
      <p>For collaborations, print enquiries, or just to say hello, <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
